{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/LibraryLogo.png?t=1743181210\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/1ST.png?t=1743181210\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I\u2019ve returned to the mansion after years, haunted by old memories. It\u2019s been shut down since the incident. I turn on my <strong>camcorder</strong> and step inside to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/SpeechRecognition.png?t=1743181210\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I switched on my<strong> microphone</strong>\u00a0and let the quiet settle in before asking the first question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cCan you hear me?\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/OuijaBoard.gif?t=1743181210\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/3rd.png?t=1743181210\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I\u2019m determined to uncover every hidden detail, <strong>documenting</strong> the entire process for the world to witness in my <strong>camcorder</strong>.\u00a0 No bookcase, painting, or door will go unchecked\u2014every corner holds a <strong>secret</strong> waiting to be revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/ExaminePainting.gif?t=1743181210\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/4th.png?t=1743181210\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I searched around the house to find <strong>clues</strong> of my family's tragedy. I found <strong>newspaper</strong> articles that never saw the light of day and someone's <strong>notes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/FindNotegif.gif?t=1743181210\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/Use_your_microphone_to_uncover_hidden_secrets.__1_-Photoroom.png?t=1743181210\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First Person horror game exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voice Recognition\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the story through Note Collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve Puzzles &amp; Riddles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537620?t=1743181210","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/4bb43e2db5197af16322f1ecad08e3d3682798c3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743181210","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/ca3700b557ac1d590d3cfb530d0b579d4d100206/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743181210","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/ca3700b557ac1d590d3cfb530d0b579d4d100206/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743181210","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st